<title>SLOVAKIA: SLOVAK CBANK FOREX RESERVES RISE TO $3.47 BLN.</title>
<headline>SLOVAK CBANK FOREX RESERVES RISE TO $3.47 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) on Friday said its hard currency reserves rose to $3.474 billion as of April 23 from $3.442 billion on April 16.</p>
<p> FOREX RESERVES	  April 23  April 16 April 2 Dec 31/96</p>
<p> NBS reserves ($bln)    3.474     3.442    3.483    3.473</p>
<p> Commercial banks	 1.872     1.881    1.799    2.321</p>
<p> Entire banking sector  5.346     5.324    5.282    5.794</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
